# Every `Source:` line container-craft carries, in page<TAB>line form.
# A page that loses one fails the sweep in container_craft_test.go naming the page
# and the line; a page that adds one fails until it is pinned here on purpose, so
# the pin follows the pages instead of drifting above them (0335).
# When a citation really changes, replace its line here and put # why: above it.

# why: the three pages that cite per section, as 0333 shipped them
